    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "为了减轻传感器噪声的影响并降低由高频动态特性引起不稳定的概率，系统在高频处的增益必须保持在较低水平。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "To alleviate the effects of sensor noise and to reduce the probability of instabilities caused by high-frequency dynamics, the gain of the system at high frequencies must be kept low.",
